  "extract": "Pilea peperomioides, the Chinese money plant, UFO plant, pancake plant, lefse plant or missionary plant, is a species of flowering plant in the nettle family Urticaceae, native to Yunnan and Sichuan provinces in southern China.",
  "extract_html": "<p><i><b>Pilea peperomioides</b></i>, the <b>Chinese money plant</b>, <b>UFO plant</b>, <b>pancake plant, lefse plant</b> or <b>missionary plant</b>, is a species of flowering plant in the nettle family Urticaceae, native to Yunnan and Sichuan provinces in southern China.</p>"
